# Backend origin, without a trailing /api.
# - Local development: leave unset to use the Vite proxy (http://localhost:5050),
#   or set it to point the dev proxy somewhere else.
# - Production build (frontend and backend on different domains): set it to the
#   deployed backend, e.g. https://socialiq-api.onrender.com, and add the frontend's
#   URL to the backend's CLIENT_URL so CORS allows it.
VITE_API_URL=
